\:901f\:5ea6\:53ca\:79ef\:5206\:9636\:6570 *)\n  darkMatterMassGeV, \
selectedScalarMassGeV, selectedSplittingGeV,  (* \
\:672c\:884c\:6d89\:53ca\:ff1a\:8f93\:5165\:6697\:7269\:8d28 chi1 \
